data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"# QA dispatch: verify the Hello greeting app\\n\\n## Your task\\n\\nVerify the developer's implementation against `DESIGN.md`. Both files are in the commit pushed to your clone at `refs/campaign/orchestrator`. Do not modify any code; report your observations.\\n\\n## Getting the work\\n\\nRun these commands in your repository:\\n\\n```sh\\ngit checkout refs/campaign/orchestrator\\n```\\n\\nThis puts you in a detached HEAD, which is fine because you commit nothing.\\n\\nIf `refs/campaign/orchestrator` is missing, stop and report it immediately.\\n\\n## What to verify\\n\\n1. Read `DESIGN.md` at the repository root.\\n2. Run the build command documented in `README.md`.\\n3. Run the serve command documented in `README.md`.\\n4. Check the served interface against `DESIGN.md`:\\n   - Header title is \\\"Hello\\\".\\n   - Footer text is \\\"Built with @codesweep-ai/ui\\\".\\n   - Greeting text is \\\"Hello, world!\\\" and is large and bold.\\n   - Default greeting colour is teal (`--color-cat-2`).\\n   - Four buttons are present, labelled Teal, Amber, Rose, Sky.\\n   - Clicking each button changes the greeting colour to the matching token.\\n5. Confirm the app uses the design system:\\n   - `package.json` lists `@codesweep-ai/ui` as a dependency.\\n   - The rendered page contains elements with `data-component=\\\"Header\\\"`, `data-component=\\\"Footer\\\"`, and `data-component=\\\"Button\\\"` (these are rendered by the package components).\\n   - The greeting colour is applied via CSS custom properties such as `var(--color-cat-2)`, not hard-coded hex values.\\n\\n## Reply\\n\\nReport what you ran, what you observed, and how you measured it. If any requirement fails, say so plainly and provide the evidence. If everything passes, state that the app meets the design.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/tmp/dispatch-qa.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_73","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789849351,"id":"chatcmpl-aee80f8f98a444b195a11e4806a697d7","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

